[
  {
    "Id": "common.resources_read",
    "Description": "Read a UTF-8 file (default type=file, target is its workspace-relative path) or published skill instructions (type=skill, target is the skill ID). referencePath belongs only to a listed skill reference. For a workspace Plan use type=plan, omit target for the selected plan or supply an exact unique title. Optional version reads history without selecting it; a current read selects its exact revision. File text delivery follows this run's model input budget; Plans and published skill sources use the same budget and excerpt selectors; reading an excerpt does not activate a skill. For large files use startLine and positive lineCount, or zero-based UTF-16 startChar and charCount for a long single line; each slice observes the current version. files.patch accepts a unique anchor from an observed excerpt of a UTF-8 source. No partial skill activation. For VBA files, procedure selects a unique procedure by name; optional procedureKind=sub/function/property-get/property-let/property-set disambiguates accessors. Do not combine with line/character selectors. For PDF files or PDF attachments, representation=text with startPage/pageCount reads consecutive complete pages within the model budget; nextPageIndex continues the range. Use pageIndex with optional startChar/charCount for a long page. Extracted text may omit visual or scanned content. Use type=attachment with the exact semantic target from discovery to read a visual selection; it does not authorize a source edit.",
